sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Coder
  participant A as medcode-api
  participant H as Hospital (iMed)
  participant R as RAG
  participant DB as medcode DB
  C->>A: Sync (date window)
  A->>H: R6 contract check, then R3 / R1→R2
  H-->>A: case objects
  A->>DB: import new · refresh open · skip approved
  C->>A: open case (lock, renewed every 30 s)
  C->>A: suggest-codes
  A->>R: /suggest {clinical_text ≤3,500 chars}
  R-->>A: ICD-10 + ICD-9 candidates
  A-->>C: suggestions (nothing written)
  C->>A: save ticked / edited codes
  A->>DB: working list stored
  C->>A: Approve
  A->>DB: phase 1: commit + finalize
  A->>H: phase 2: diff → cancel / edit / create
  A->>DB: journal each hospital row
